    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an Ogiri adventure game where you collect and carry items around the map and offer them to the goddess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items and continue offering while paying attention to your budget and time limit. In the end, if you have a lot of ``emotion meter'', you will be happy with the goddess, but if you don't have a lot, you may get angry...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can try it as many times as you like, so don't give up and have fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383050/extras/b7c68006b5a944b3017c9fbc54ea0449.avif?t=1738333119\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation instructions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with WASD or controller left stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the enter key or \u3007 button to confirm and talk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with RPG Developer Bakin. Depending on your computer environment, operation may become slow.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an Ogiri adventure game where you collect and carry items around the map and offer them to the goddess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items and continue offering while paying attention to your budget and time limit. In the end, if you have a lot of ``emotion meter'', you will be happy with the goddess, but if you don't have a lot, you may get angry...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can try it as many times as you like, so don't give up and have fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383050/extras/b7c68006b5a944b3017c9fbc54ea0449.avif?t=1738333119\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation instructions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with WASD or controller left stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the enter key or \u3007 button to confirm and talk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with RPG Developer Bakin. Depending on your computer environment, operation may become slow.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Ogiri Adventure Game&quot; is a quest to gather and donate items to please the Goddess. Find theme-based items highlighted in red, donate within the budget, and raise the emotion meter. A high meter brings joy, while a low one may cause anger. Keep trying!",
